  "title": "Employee Remunerations — Create / Edit",
  "entity": "HCMv3.PersonnelAdministration.EmployeeRemuneration",
  "overviewHtml": "<p>Days or hours to be paid for the employee on a date, for employees paid by the day or hour.</p><p>When the employee's basic pay interval is Daily or Hourly, payroll adds up the days or hours recorded here in the month and pays them at the basic pay rate.</p>",
