      ],
      "rules": "Optional. Chosen from Wage Type master data.",
      "when": null,
      "html": "<p><strong>What it is.</strong> A wage type recorded with the entry.</p><p><strong>Example.</strong> Basic Salary</p><p><strong>Why it matters.</strong> The daily and hourly calculation counts every entry in the month, whatever its wage type.</p>",
